{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-wild-chan-critique","title":"近禅之讥与狂禅流弊","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/the-wild-chan-critique","wordCount":1789,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"action-and-quietism","title":"事功与心性之辩","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/action-and-quietism","wordCount":1724,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章审视围绕王阳明的两场争议。\"近禅之讥\"——王阳明心学因高扬\"心\"、注重内在体悟而被批评为\"近禅\"，其后学更有\"狂禅\"流弊；本章辨析了儒禅之别，指出王阳明心学根本精神是彻底的儒家。\"事功与心性之辩\"——则揭示王阳明如何完美地统一了内圣与外王、心学与事功，成为\"知行合一\"的最高典范。本章以全面的态度辨析这些争议。\n"}